    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d216">

                <pb facs="0309" n="298" sameAs="frus:frus1937v02/pg298"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">811.114 St. Pierre-Miquelon/443: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Ambassador in
                        France</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Bullitt</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1937-01-25T19:00:00-05:00">January 25, 1937—7
                        p.m.</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>37. Your No. 1275, December 18, 3 p.m.<anchor n="30" xml:id="d216-f1"/> Treasury
                    Department believes it would be mutually helpful if it could receive an outline
                    of proposed decree to replace one now in effect at St. Pierre-Miquelon before it
                    is finally adopted. Please endeavor to obtain and telegraph desired information
                    if you can properly do so.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
